<title>NEW ZEALAND: Blue Star now has 90.7 pct of McCollam.</title>
<headline>Blue Star now has 90.7 pct of McCollam.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Star Office Technology, part of the U.S Office Products Co vehicle bidding for New Zealand's McCollam Printers Ltd, has increased its voting stake to 90.7 percent from 78.34, Blue Star said in a notice to the NZ Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Blue Star launched a takeover bid for McCollam on May 16, saying it would pay NZ$2.75 per share to shareholders other than controlling family interests with whom it intended to strike a separate deal.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
